  "description": "CEGDIE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C202 H272 Gd4 Mn4 N8 O38,3(C3 H7 N1 O1),2(C1 H4 O1),0.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.462-4.854 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.77-162.29°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [MnIII4GdIII4(BisTBC[4])2(μ3-OH)4(μ-CO3)2(dmf)8(H2O)4](MeOH)(dmf)2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Mn(III), Gd(III).",
